{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 80,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During the COVID lockdown, this headline went viral:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3200,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Nearly half of men say they do most of the homeschooling..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7040,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "...three percent of women agree.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9620,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I bring this up not to debate who's right, but because it's a great example of something called egocentric bias:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16160,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most people think they do most of the work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19840,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, researchers have asked authors of multi-author papers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23680,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what percentage of the work they personally did,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26900,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when they add up those percentages, the sum is on average"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29980,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "140 percent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32080,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When couples are asked to estimate how much of the housework they do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35140,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the combined total is almost always over 100%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39280,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you might think this is because people want to appear more helpful than they actually are,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44120,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's not it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45680,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When couples are asked what fraction of the fights they start or how much of the mess is theirs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50000,
    "dDurationMs": 4239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the total is again over a hundred. People think they do more of the work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54399,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they also think they cause more of the problems. So why is this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58480,
    "dDurationMs": 4319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's simply because you experience and remember vividly all of what you do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63120,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not all of what everyone else does,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65260,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so naturally you overestimate your own contributions and underestimate others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70240,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think this bias leads us to underestimate the influence of other things on our lives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75260,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the role luck plays in our success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78080,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take hockey players, for example."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79840,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you ask a professional hockey player how they managed to reach the NHL,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83280,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they might mention their hard work, determination, great coaches, their parents willingness to get up at 5 AM, and so on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88960,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they probably won't acknowledge how lucky they were to be born in January. And yet, in many years 40%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95360,
    "dDurationMs": 5599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of hockey players selected into top tier leagues are born in the first quarter of the year, compared to just 10%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101200,
    "dDurationMs": 5919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the fourth quarter; an early birthday can make you up to four times as likely to be a pro hockey player."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107520,
    "dDurationMs": 5599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reason for this disparity is presumably because the cutoff date for kids hockey leagues is January 1st."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113600,
    "dDurationMs": 6780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those born in the first part of the year are a little older and so on average bigger and faster than kids in their league born late in the year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120800,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now as they grow up, this difference should eventually shrink to nothing, but it doesn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125439,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the young kids who share the most promise are given more time on the ice and enter more tournaments, where they receive better coaching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131520,
    "dDurationMs": 4239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and improve their skills. And these advantages compound year after year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135840,
    "dDurationMs": 4639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so by the time you get to the pros, birthdays are heavily skewed towards the start of the year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140959,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But does any professional hockey player feel thankful for their birthday?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144459,
    "dDurationMs": 6340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Probably not. And we are all like that, largely oblivious to the fortunate events that support our success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151280,
    "dDurationMs": 4559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Probably the most significant bit of luck many of us enjoy is being born into a prosperous country;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156400,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around half the variance in income received by people around the world is explained by their country of residence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161480,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that country's income distribution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163680,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you were born in Burundi, for example, which has the world's lowest gross national income per capita of just 730 dollars a year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170080,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it doesn't matter how smart or hard-working you are; you're unlikely to earn much as an adult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175300,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now many people get offended if you point out how big a role chance plays in their success"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179680,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I get it. If we are just a product of our circumstances,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182720,
    "dDurationMs": 3279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then our hard work and our talent seem to count for nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186480,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People think it has to be either skill or luck that explains success, but the truth is you need both."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193200,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take these eight track and field world records: all the athletes who achieve these records are obviously"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198080,
    "dDurationMs": 7060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "world class, extremely dedicated, and talented and yet, when they achieved their world records, seven out of eight had a tailwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205520,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now these athletes all had the ability to win a gold medal, but to set the world record required a bit of luck as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211980,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The importance of luck increases the greater the number of applicants applying for just a few spaces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217680,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Consider the most recent class of NASA astronauts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220640,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From over 18,300 applicants in 2017,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224960,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only 11 were selected and went on to graduate from the astronaut training program."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229900,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we can make a toy model of the selection process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233280,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's assume that astronauts are selected mostly based on skill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236740,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experience, and hard work, but also say five percent as a result of luck — fortunate circumstances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243360,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For each applicant, I randomly generated a skill score out of a hundred,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247180,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I also randomly generated a luck score out of a hundred."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250960,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I added those numbers together, weighted in the 95-to-5 ratio to get an overall score."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257440,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This score represents the selector's judgments, meaning the top 11 by this metric would become astronauts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264639,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I repeated this simulation a thousand times representing a thousand different astronaut selections."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270800,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I found was the astronauts who were picked were very lucky; they had an average luck score of 94.7."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278560,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how many of the selected astronauts would have been in the top 11 based on skill alone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284400,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer was, on average, only 1.6."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288240,
    "dDurationMs": 7780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means, even with luck accounting for just 5% of the outcome, 9 or maybe 10 of the 11 applicants selected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296240,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have been different if luck played no role at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300560,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When competition is fierce, being talented and hard-working is important, but it's not enough to guarantee success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306540,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You also need to catch a break."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309200,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Largely, I think we're unaware of our good luck because, by definition, it's not something we did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314120,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the housework done by your significant other, it goes unappreciated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318400,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here's the crazy thing:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319760,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Downplaying the importance of chance events may actually improve your probability of success because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325840,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you perceive an outcome to be uncertain, you're less likely to invest effort in it, which further decreases your chances of success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332479,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, it's a useful delusion to believe you are in full control of your destiny."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337360,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if I had known how bad I was when I started YouTube or how much work it would take, I might have given up right then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343420,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Welcome to Veritasium:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345360,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an online science video blog.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347620,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now there may be another benefit to overlooking your lucky breaks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is it makes it easier to justify your place in society:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354640,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you have a lot of wealth or power, you can just chalk it up to your own intelligence, effort, and perseverance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360160,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes it easier to accept inequality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363200,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In one experiment, participants were put in groups of three in small rooms to discuss a complex moral problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369440,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and one person in each group was randomly designated the team leader."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373360,
    "dDurationMs": 3679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Half an hour later, the experimenter came by with four cookies for each team."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377520,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So who got the extra cookie? In each case, it went to the team leader. Even though they had no special aptitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383759,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they didn't have extra responsibilities and they'd gotten their position through chance alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once you have achieved a certain status,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390400,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it seems natural to feel like you deserve it and all the other good things that come your way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395280,
    "dDurationMs": 1359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this is just an anecdote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396640,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but whenever I've been upgraded to fly a business class, I've always observed the worst behavior in my fellow privileged passengers;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403120,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they just act so entitled and uncourteous. And research has found evidence for this as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409280,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In another experiment, participants were asked to think of a good thing that happened to them recently,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413920,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then one group was asked to list their own personal qualities or actions that made that good thing happen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418880,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "another group was asked to list external factors beyond their control that led to the event,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423340,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a control group was simply asked to list reasons why the good thing happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426960,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now for completing this task, participants were told they would be paid a dollar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430560,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but at the end they were offered the option to donate some or all of the money to a charity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435600,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Results showed those who listed their own personal attributes contributed 25% less"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441080,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than those who listed external factors beyond their control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444480,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now think of what all this means for people in our society,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447440,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "specifically for people in positions of power like business leaders and politicians."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451600,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now undoubtedly most of them are talented and hard-working,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455039,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they have also been luckier than most, and like most of us, they don't realize just how lucky they are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461599,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this gives them a distorted view of reality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464560,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're kind of living in a form of survivor bias: all these leaders have worked hard and ultimately succeeded,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470560,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so to them the world appears fair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473060,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In their experience, it rewards hard work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475420,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but what they don't have is the experience of all the people who have worked hard and failed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480240,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what are they to make of people less successful than themselves?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483280,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the natural conclusion is that they must just be less talented or less hard-working,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488080,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this perspective makes them less inclined to be generous — to give back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492160,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they are the ones who set the rules for how society operates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495840,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is particularly unfortunate since one of the main ways many of us are lucky is in our country of residence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502080,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what is a country except for the things put there by people who came before?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506120,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The roads and the schools, public transport, emergency services, clean air and water, everything like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512080,
    "dDurationMs": 8220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems a cruel trick of our psychology that successful people without any malice will credit their success largely to their own hard work and ingenuity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520480,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore contribute less to maintaining the very"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523200,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "circumstances that made that success possible in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527000,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The good news is that acknowledging our fortunate circumstances not only brings us more in line with reality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532700,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it also makes us more likeable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534720,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a study where people had to read the transcript of a fictional 60-minutes interview with a biotech entrepreneur,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540300,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experimenters tried changing just the last paragraph where the interviewee is talking about the reasons for their company's success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546480,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In one version, the entrepreneur personally takes credit for the success they've had,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550740,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in the other, he says luck played a significant role."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554240,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now people who read the luck version of the transcript judged the entrepreneur as kinder,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558320,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and thought they'd be more likely to be close friends with him than those who read the other version of the transcript."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563520,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And raising our awareness of fortunate events can also make us happier because it allows us to feel gratitude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570480,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Personally, I am grateful to Michael Stevens of Vsauce,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573260,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who on October 7th, 2012, posted the video: \"How Much Does a Shadow Weigh?\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577840,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which shouts out my slow-motion slinky drop video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580260,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and within three days my subscribers had increased by a third, and within a month,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584240,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they had doubled, leading me to quit my part-time job and work exclusively on YouTube videos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588880,
    "dDurationMs": 2079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm grateful to the writer of the free newspaper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590960,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they give out on the trains in Sydney who didn't quite understand electricity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594320,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leading me to post this picture of their article to my Instagram with the caption: \"What's wrong with this picture?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599200,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm lucky that the first person to answer correctly was a beautiful woman who became my future wife."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605280,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yep!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606240,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is how I met your mother."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608399,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now initially, I wanted to make this video just to say our circumstances and psychology conspire to make us oblivious to our own luck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615680,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This leads successful people to view the world as fair,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618180,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those less successful than them as less talented or less hard-working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622320,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is before you factor in any discrimination or prejudice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626160,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, it also became apparent to me that I should talk about what to do if you want to be successful in such a world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631840,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think the best advice is paradoxical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634960,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, you must believe that you are in complete control of your destiny,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639180,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that your success comes down only to your own talent and hard work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643360,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But second, you've got to know that's not true for you or anyone else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648480,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you have to remember: if you do achieve success that luck played a significant role and given your good fortune,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654560,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you should do what you can to increase the luck of others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661200,
    "dDurationMs": 5919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, so I had an idea for what I could do to increase the luck of others and that is to give away a hundred"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667279,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "snatoms kits to people who couldn't otherwise afford them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670000,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, if you didn't know snatoms is a product that I invented and kick-started five years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674640,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a molecular modeling kit where all the atoms snap together magnetically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680400,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I made it because I really wanted to tackle the misconception that bonds store energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685120,
    "dDurationMs": 4399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't. It takes energy to break them, and you can feel that with snatoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690160,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Recently, I completely retooled snatums. So there are small holes where the magnets are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695200,
    "dDurationMs": 8160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This allows them to touch directly, increasing the bonding strength, so you can form bigger more stable molecules. I call these \"snatomsX\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703600,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yes, they are backwards compatible with original snatoms. So, here's my idea:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708140,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the next month you can buy snatoms for 10% off using the code \"giveluck\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712000,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and for each one sold, I will give a kit to someone who can't afford one, up to a limit of a hundred."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716780,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I'll put links and more details in the description, and I really want to thank you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720399,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for watching, and thank you for all my good luck."
    } ]
  } ]
}
